{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1473946-mission-statements-what-when-where","id":1473946,"title":"Mission Statements? What? When? Where?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-03T19:38:30-08:00","id":1473946,"title":"Mission Statements? What? When? Where?","content":"Man, I feel like a noob, but I've apparently missed all of the chatter regarding Mission Statements. Where can I find info about what this book will be (it's not out yet, right?)?<br /> <br /> All I know is I was reading Prometheus Unbound and I kept seeing these links to Mission Statements, which I initially though was a section in each chapter, but only realized that wasn't the case after reading more than half of the book and never seeing such a section.<br /> <br /> Lol. Look, I'm not always this clueless. It's been a rough couple of months, friends. I'm a pharmacist. My brain has been eaten by testing and boosters.<br /> <br /> Anyways, any info or pointing in the right direction would be appreciated. Thanks!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-03T22:07:27-08:00","id":1473951,"title":"","content":"<i>Mission Statements</i> is the TC: Aeon big book of organizations for everything except the psi orders. (Well, Orgotek is also in MS, but for the corporate elements, not the psi order.) It includes expanded details for the UN, the Aeon Trinity, various metacorporations, media groups, etc. It also has a bunch of antagonist organizations, threats and wonders for characters to explore, and rules for running organizations as antagonists for characters to interact with.<br /> <br /> MS was written before PU and was meant to come out of the publication pipeline first, but due to arcane elements in the process PU made it into readers\u2019 hands first, which is why it has various references to MS.<br /> <br /> We\u2019ve had some discussion of it over on the Onyx Path Discord. If you haven\u2019t signed into that you should jump over there and join us.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-04T08:27:30-08:00","id":1473975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1473946-mission-statements-what-when-where?p=1473951#post1473951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Mission Statements</i> is the TC: Aeon big book of organizations for everything except the psi orders. (Well, Orgotek is also in MS, but for the corporate elements, not the psi order.) It includes expanded details for the UN, the Aeon Trinity, various metacorporations, media groups, etc. It also has a bunch of antagonist organizations, threats and wonders for characters to explore, and rules for running organizations as antagonists for characters to interact with.<br /> <br /> MS was written before PU and was meant to come out of the publication pipeline first, but due to arcane elements in the process PU made it into readers\u2019 hands first, which is why it has various references to MS.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahhh.... thanks!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1473946-mission-statements-what-when-where?p=1473951#post1473951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We\u2019ve had some discussion of it over on the Onyx Path Discord. If you haven\u2019t signed into that you should jump over there and join us.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am actually signed on there. I just haven't had the brain to follow the discussions yet. Lol<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-04T11:13:51-08:00","id":1473987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1473946-mission-statements-what-when-where?p=1473951#post1473951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Mission Statements</i> is the TC: Aeon big book of organizations for everything except the psi orders. (Well, Orgotek is also in MS, but for the corporate elements, not the psi order.) It includes expanded details for the UN, the Aeon Trinity, various metacorporations, media groups, etc. It also has a bunch of antagonist organizations, threats and wonders for characters to explore, and rules for running organizations as antagonists for characters to interact with.<br /> <br /> MS was written before PU and was meant to come out of the publication pipeline first, but due to arcane elements in the process PU made it into readers\u2019 hands first, which is why it has various references to MS.<br /> <br /> We\u2019ve had some discussion of it over on the Onyx Path Discord. If you haven\u2019t signed into that you should jump over there and join us.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for the info, I was also wondering about mission statements. I know you don't give specific dates, but can you tell us more or less when do you think it will be ready? One month? Couple of months? Summer? Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-04T12:05:04-08:00","id":1473990,"title":"","content":"Looks like it still needs to go through layout and proofing at the very least. (It might still need some art and finishing the post-editing development.) I would guess at least a month, probably closer to two, but that's my SWAG.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-05T11:30:00-08:00","id":1474046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1473946-mission-statements-what-when-where?p=1473987#post1473987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Thanks for the info, I was also wondering about mission statements. I know you don't give specific dates, but can you tell us more or less when do you think it will be ready? One month? Couple of months? Summer? Thanks in advance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your best bet is to check the current progress in the production rundown, which can now be found in the monthly <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/the-all-new-all-different-release-roundup-january-2022/\" target=\"_blank\">Release Roundup posts.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /